            "block_content": "4. Upon receipt of the \"Disability Insurance Notice of Computation\" form DE 429 from the employee, the Employer shall pay any sickness benefits due the employee on the next payroll period immediately following receipt of the form DE 429 and return the form to the employee for his/her records, provided the Employer has a current medical certification of inability to work on file.",
